Edits made by hand when the patched dwm was first imported, before the repo had
history: a minimum size for floating windows, only the selected tag underlined,
preserveonrestart reworked in manage(), a single layout (no monocle or
setlayout, which a later patch brings back), no snapping, the master area
dragged live, unmanage() arranging first, 4-space indentation in the patched
functions, and the Makefile and config.mk tweaks. Drops README and dwm.png.

